{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>רב לכם.</b> You have taken far too much greatness for yourselves." "<b>כלם קדשים.</b> All of them heard words at Sinai from the mouth of the Gevurah." "<b>ומדוע תתנשאו.</b> If you took the kingship, you should not have selected the priesthood for your brother. It is not you alone who heard at Sinai ״אָנֹכִי ה' אֱלֹהֶיךָ״ — the entire assembly heard (ibid.)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:11.378145449Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}